@startuml
title RevenuePulse AI - Final workflow with human-in-the-loop review

skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam swimlaneWidth 210
skinparam wrapWidth 230

|Sales Manager|
start
:Select review date (quarter-end snapshot)\nor upload account-month data;

|RevenuePulse AI|
:Data validation\n(required fields, dates, duplicates);
if (Data valid?) then (no)
  :Reject with readable error;\nrequest corrected extract;
  |Sales Manager|
  stop
else (yes)
  |RevenuePulse AI|
  :Feature generation\n(point-in-time only, no future data);
  if (Model available?) then (no)
    |RevenuePulse AI|
    :Controlled error:\nmanual review only;
    |Sales Manager|
    :Review accounts manually;
    stop
  else (yes)
    |RevenuePulse AI|
    :AI risk prediction\n(histogram gradient boosting);
    :Build ranked review queue\n(risk probability + band);
    :Risk explanation\n(rule-based reason codes);
    :Suggested next action\n(transparent rules, no LLM);
  endif
endif

|Sales Manager|
if (Risk band?) then (low)
  :Monitor - no immediate action;
else (medium)
  :Review recommended\n(advisory, not definitive);
else (high)
  :High-priority review;
endif

:Inspect account evidence\n(revenue, trend, engagement, activity);

|Human Review|
if (Decision?) then (Accept)
  :Accept AI suggestion;
elseif (Edit)
  :Amend recommendation\n+ optional note;
else (Dismiss)
  :Dismiss suggestion\n+ optional note;
endif

|Audit Log|
:Save decision\n(timestamp, account, snapshot date,\nrisk score, AI suggestion, decision,\nedited text, reviewer note);

|Sales Manager|
:Human decides any follow-up\noutside the system;
stop

note right of |Human Review|
  No automated customer contact.
  No pricing or offer changes.
  No CRM write-back.
  Human approval is mandatory.
end note

@enduml
